  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRA Ethiopia Tigray Joint Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Emergency ES/NFI and WASH response in Tigray. Distribution of emergency shelter kits, NFI kits, dignity kits and WASH kits. Construction of semi permanent latrines with hand washing stations and hygiene promotion at several IDP locations. In close collaboration with SOS (Mekelle/Enderta), Cordaid (Enderta) and Tearfund (Shire).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
