    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">All indicators need a full presence of delegates of the vulnerable people in targeting, verification, distribution and monitoring process. The targeting of the vulnerable communities will be reviewed and evaluated by the identified community representatives to control biasedness and increase transparency of the program delivery. Likewise, the project indicators will be evaluated and referred by the community representatives to cross check how the project is effectively done.</narrative>
